direction is a musical indication that is not necessarily attached to a specific note. Two or more may be","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"combined to indicate words followed by the start of a dashed line, the end of a wedge followed by dynamics,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"etc. For applications where a specific direction is indeed attached to a specific note, the direction element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can be associated with the first note element that follows it in score order that is not in a different voice."}]}}}